\[\varepsilon_{\theta}\equiv\frac{\int\limits_{-1}^{0.77}\int \limits_{a}^{b}g^{\rm RC}(t,\cos(\theta^{*}_{\rm RC})){\rm d}t{\rm d}\!\!\cos( \theta^{*})}{\int\limits_{-1}^{1}\int\limits_{a}^{b}g^{\rm RC}(t,\cos(\theta^ {*})){\rm d}t{\rm d}\!\!\cos(\theta^{*})} \tag{4.12}\]

